    "title": "Adoraboo - Raise Boos Together",
    "description": "Save your Boo under the rainbow bridge! Start an amazing journey of love and memories with your friends.\r\n\r\nVisit your neighbors\r\nBecome neighbors with your friends, have Boo playdates together and share love. Help take care of begging Boos or retrieve stray ones!\r\n\r\nTake care of your Boo\r\nFeed your Boo regularly to keep it healthy! Your Boo will earn coins for you.\r\n\r\nDress up your Boo\r\nDress your Boo in cool outfits! Match your home or island style with your Boo's look.\r\n\r\nDiscover Boo's past\r\nEvery Boo has a secret past. Your love helps it open up and share its past life stories bit by bit. With your love and care, your Boo will live a happy new life!\r\n\r\n-----\r\nContact us: official@adoraboo.net\r\nTerms of Services: https://www.adoraboo.net/terms.html\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.adoraboo.net/privacy.html",
